{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cuv","name":"新標點和合本","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmn-cu89t","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CUV","englishName":"Chinese Union Version (traditional)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"923f114ccc6ab7fc558e054f84df5214fa9782ca7c02882cf173417a0d1d641e","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":31021,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ZEC","translationId":"cmn_cuv","name":"撒迦利亞書","commonName":"撒迦利亞書","title":"撒迦利亞書","order":38,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"596e12e88f20bda085f475cd8057e433ebcfbd7db4b18a72e7597b0902128ee5","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":211},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["飛卷的異象"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我又舉目觀看，見有一飛行的書卷。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他問我說：「你看見甚麼？」我回答說：「我看見一飛行的書卷，長二十肘，寬十肘。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他對我說：「這是發出行在遍地上的咒詛。凡偷竊的必按卷上這面的話除滅；凡起假誓的必按卷上那面的話除滅。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["萬軍之耶和華說：我必使這書卷出去，進入偷竊人的家和指我名起假誓人的家，必常在他家裏，連房屋帶木石都毀滅了。」"]},{"type":"heading","content":["量器中婦人的異象"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["與我說話的天使出來，對我說：「你要舉目觀看，見所出來的是甚麼？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["我說：「這是甚麼呢？」他說：「這出來的是量器。」他又說：「這是惡人在遍地的形狀。」"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["（我見有一片圓鉛被舉起來。）這坐在量器中的是個婦人。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["天使說：「這是罪惡。」他就把婦人扔在量器中，將那片圓鉛扔在量器的口上。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我又舉目觀看，見有兩個婦人出來，在她們翅膀中有風，飛得甚快，翅膀如同鸛鳥的翅膀。她們將量器抬起來，懸在天地中間。"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我問與我說話的天使說：「她們要將量器抬到哪裏去呢？」"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["他對我說：「要往示拿地去，為它蓋造房屋；等房屋齊備，就把它安置在自己的地方。」"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cuv/ZEC/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}